additional_context = "Use the pack_stocks helper from solver_lib to implement a first-fit bin-packing routine that (1) respects each piece's min/max counts, (2) tries both orientations per stock_type, (3) greedily fills existing stocks of the same type before opening new ones, and (4) only opens the minimal number of stocks needed. This will reduce waste and reach the archive best-known objective of 0.140 on assortment_problem."